Times New Roman'; color: black;\">Now Hiring:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black;\">&nbsp;Cook</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black;\">Job Type:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black;\">40 hour and 16 hour positions available</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black;\">Responsibilities of Cook:</span></em></strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Prepare food according to selected menus and approved recipes.</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Complete the preparation of all food items in a timely manner and assure that all foods meet the required serving temperatures</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"